                "loc": "MRK.6.31+MRK.6.32+MRK.6.33+MRK.6.34+MRK.6.35+MRK.6.36+MRK.6.37+MRK.6.38+MRK.6.39+MRK.6.40+MRK.6.41+MRK.6.42+MRK.6.43+MRK.6.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 6:31-44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.6.1+JHN.6.2+JHN.6.3+JHN.6.4+JHN.6.5+JHN.6.6+JHN.6.7+JHN.6.8+JHN.6.9+JHN.6.10+JHN.6.11+JHN.6.12+JHN.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 6:1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yesu ku yaabihuriire, yaarugayo, yaagyendera omu bwato, yaaza omu ihamba kwehereera; abantu baingi ku baakimanyire, baaruga omuri tauni, baaraba ogw'ebigyere, baamukurata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaayambukire, yaashangayo emitwe mingi y'abantu, yaabagirira embabazi, yaatambira abarwaire baabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bwaizire, abeegi be baija ah'ari, baamugira bati: Aha n'eihamba; kandi bwizire. Raga abantu bagyende omu birorero, beeshakire eby'okurya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Tihariho kirikubatwara; mubagaburire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamugarukamu bati: Eki twine aha n'emigaati etaano n'eby'enyanja bibiri kwonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagira ati: Mubindeetere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaragiira emitwe y'abantu kushutama omu kacwamba; yaayakiira egyo migaati etaano n'eby'enyanja bibiri, yaareeba ahaiguru, yaasiima, yaabega emigaati, yaagiha abeegi be, nabo baagaburira abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 4:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Boona baarya, baahaaga. Bwanyima baatorotoora oburagarika obwatsigaraho, baijuza ebitenga ikumi na bibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abaariire bakaba bari abashaija enkumi itaano, otabariiremu bakazi n'abaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
